# part       : J1 -- wing tab, 4-pin interface (4 solder lands; the finger substrate is board outline)
# dims_mm    : 4 lands 4.0 x 1.2 x 0.035 thick at 1.8 mm pitch, land row centred at x = -5 mm, y = 9.8 / 11.6 / 13.4 / 15.2 mm; pinout 1=SOLAR_P 2=GND 3=RF_FEED 4=SOLAR_N
# frame      : X = footprint-local +x, Y = -(footprint-local +y), Z = up, Z=0 at the board TOP face
